3. MANDATORY ATTRIBUTION & SYSTEM SIGNATURE CO-EXISTENCE
   Any Android ROM image, package, or firmware built, modified, or ported 
   using this software (or any derived forks) must comply with the following:
   
   a) Credit to the original tool (CSM by Minhmc2077) must be visibly and 
